{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Versioned Prompt Contracts.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Versioned Prompt Contracts.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"versioned prompt contracts versioned prompt contracts","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Versioned Prompt Contracts.md","fileName":"Versioned Prompt Contracts.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Versioned Prompt Contracts","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI Pipeline Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Pipeline Engineering","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Versioned Prompt Contracts.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Versioned Prompt Contracts.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"versioned prompt contracts versioned prompt contracts","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Versioned Prompt Contracts.md","fileName":"Versioned Prompt Contracts.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Versioned Prompt Contracts","heading":"Versioned Prompt Contracts","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A versioned prompt contract stores operational instructions in source control and defines the model's role, trusted instruction source, prohibited behavior, and required output structure. It is a dependency of the workflow, not transient text pasted into a chat.\n\nThe contract can require exact headings or a JSON schema, forbid invention, and identify untrusted fields as data. Because validation logic depends on the same structure, a prompt change must be reviewed and tested together with its parser and checks. Versioning makes behavioral changes traceable and reversible.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI Pipeline Engineering","agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Ver